  "slug": "furcamp",
  "name": "FURCAMP",
  "shortName": null,
  "description": "FURCAMP is a furry camping event in Brazil, held at campsites in the state of São Paulo during the Carnival holiday, usually in February. A pilot edition took place in March 2019. There were no in-person editions in 2021 and 2022 because of the pandemic, and none in 2025. Each edition follows a story theme, from vikings in 2019 to pirates in 2026, and attendees earn points for themselves or their team in games and gymkhanas. Lodging and meals are included in the ticket, and only adults aged 18 or over may attend. The 2026 edition had 170 attendees, and the 2027 edition moves to Acampamento Aruanã in Embu-Guaçu.",
